  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Base class for layouts that arrange items in collection and carousel views.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
      <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout" /> is the abstract base class for item arrangement strategies used in <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.CollectionView" /> and <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.CarouselView" />.
            It defines common properties like <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout.Orientation" />, <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout.SnapPointsType" />, and <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout.SnapPointsAlignment" />
            that control how items are laid out and how scrolling behaves.
            Concrete implementations include <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.LinearItemsLayout" /> and <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.GridItemsLayout" />.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
