        <summary>
            Gets or sets how items align to snap points when scrolling stops.
            </summary>
        <value>A <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout.SnapPointsAlignment" /> value. The default is <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SnapPointsAlignment.Start" />.</value>
        <remarks>
            This property only applies when <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout.SnapPointsType" /> is not <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SnapPointsType.None" />.
            It controls whether items snap to the start, center, or end of the visible area.
            </remarks>
