      <Docs>
        <summary>
            Gets or sets the snap points behavior when scrolling.
            </summary>
        <value>A <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.ItemsLayout.SnapPointsType" /> value. The default is <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SnapPointsType.None" />.</value>
        <remarks>
            Snap points cause scrolling to "snap" to specific item positions, creating a paging-like effect.
            Set this to <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SnapPointsType.Mandatory" /> or <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.SnapPointsType.MandatorySingle" /> to enable snapping behavior.
            </remarks>
